### Motors API Testing Collection (REST Client & Thunder Client)
### Compatible with humao.rest-client and rangav.vscode-thunder-client

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@testEmail = samartharava@gmail.com
@testPassword = Samarth@#$07

### 1. Backend Server Health & DB Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/status
Accept: application/json

### 2. User Authentication (Login)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### 3. Extract Token from Login Response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 4. Authenticated User Profile (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Initiate Password Recovery (OTP Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/request-password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}"
}

### 6. Verify OTP Code (Enter code received in Gmail/test inbox)
# @name verifyOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 7. Reset Password with Recovery Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "recoveryToken": "PASTE_RECOVERY_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword@123"
}

### 8. Fetch Vehicle Marketplace Inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json

### 9. Submit Customer Enquiry (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Buyer Demo",
  "phone": "+91 9876543210",
  "email": "buyer.demo@example.com",
  "vehicleId": "hero-splendor-plus-2022",
  "vehicleName": "Hero Splendor Plus (2022)",
  "message": "Interested in inspecting this bike.",
  "dealType": "BUY_USED"
}
